    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00071",
        "explanation": "Doctor summarises the plan and obtains patient confirmation of understanding and next steps.",
        "quote": "你现在的做法非常稳妥，既避免了用药错误的风险，也明确了明天要解决的关键问题。今晚就先这样处理，尽量让自己舒服一点。"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00300",
        "explanation": "Doctor gives clear escalation plan and patient confirms red-flag understanding in later turn.",
        "quote": "如果出现以上任何一种，就别再犹豫，直接去急诊。"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The doctor progressively simplifies the plan, uses teach-back, and resolves medication/device confusion. The patient repeatedly confirms understanding of red flags, no-forceful-blowing behavior, follow-up timing, and record preparation. The final exchange shows the patient correctly applying the plan at home, and the doctor provides clear escalation instructions and a feasible next step.",
    "label": "valid_closure",
