        "explanation": "Doctor clarifies the episode context by asking about recent hospitalisation, medications, and symptom pattern, distinguishing it from routine rhinitis.",
        "quote": "你大概是什么时候出院的？出院时医生有没有给你开什么药？"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
